---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { sitePath } from "@/lib/paths";
---
<LegalLayout locale="en" currentPath="/en/privacy-policy" title="Privacy Policy" description="Information about privacy and the protection of your data when using the OrtoDent website.">
  <section><h2>1. Scope of this policy</h2><p>This policy describes privacy when browsing the OrtoDent informational website and contacting us. For data-protection questions, email <a href="mailto:info@ortodent.rs">info@ortodent.rs</a>.</p><p>The processing of medical records in our centres and the use of OrtoCloud accounts are governed by separate notices and the terms of the relevant service provider. This page does not replace those notices.</p></section>
  <section><h2>2. Information you provide</h2><p>When you contact us by email or phone, you may provide your email address, name, contact details and the content of your enquiry. Please provide only the information needed for a response. Do not send medical images, passwords or sensitive health information in a general enquiry.</p><p>The contact form in the current version of the website is not connected to a message-delivery service. Information entered there is not sent to OrtoDent. Please use email or the telephone number of a centre listed on the <a href={sitePath("/lokacije", "en")}>Locations</a> page.</p></section>
  <section><h2>3. Purpose and legal basis</h2><p>We use information from direct communication to answer your enquiry and provide requested information. Depending on the enquiry, the legal basis may be taking steps at your request before providing a service, complying with a legal obligation or our legitimate interest in responding to business communication. Where consent is required, it will be requested separately and may be withdrawn.</p></section>
  <section><h2>4. Technical data and external services</h2><p>When you open a page, your browser sends the server technical data required to display the website, including an IP address and browser information. The informational pages do not include marketing tracking or visitor analytics tools.</p><p>Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. Pages with maps may load data from an external map service. These services receive technical request data and apply their own privacy policies. Links to OrtoCloud and other websites lead to separate services.</p></section>
  <section><h2>5. Retention and access</h2><p>Communication data is retained for as long as necessary to handle the enquiry and meet applicable legal obligations. The specific period depends on the type of communication and relationship with the service provider. Access should be limited to people who need it to handle the enquiry or comply with legal obligations.</p></section>
  <section><h2>6. Your rights</h2><p>Subject to the Serbian Law on Personal Data Protection and its conditions, you may request access, correction, deletion, restriction or portability, object to processing, or withdraw consent where consent is the legal basis. Send requests to <a href="mailto:info@ortodent.rs">info@ortodent.rs</a>.</p><p>If you believe processing is unlawful, you may lodge a complaint with the <a href="https://poverenik.rs/">Commissioner for Information of Public Importance and Personal Data Protection</a>.</p></section>
  <section><h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2><p>This policy is updated when website functions or data-processing practices change. Last updated: 12 September 2026.</p></section>
</LegalLayout>
